OL,3,GNEWSAThree murder arrests after body
OL,4,Afound
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree men have been arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of murder after a man's body
OL,8,Fwas found in a property.
OL,10,FNorthamptonshire Police said it
OL,11,Fbelieved the man, in his 50s, died
OL,12,Fseveral days before his body was
OL,13,Fdiscovered.
OL,15,FOfficers went to the address on High
OL,16,FStreet in Burton Latimer on Wednesday
OL,17,Fafternoon after receiving a "concern
OL,18,Ffor welfare" call.
OL,20,FTwo other people have been arrested on
OL,21,Fsuspicion of assisting an offender.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
